# Optional read-only snapshot source, controlled by the deployment owner.
# Host a snapshot generated from the complete canonical trade prefix.
# This is a trusted publisher; the checksum detects corruption, not authorship.
# Never point this at an untrusted user-uploaded JSON file.
RATTERY_SNAPSHOT_URL=
# Existing RATTERY_CHAIN_ID, RATTERY_CA, RATTERY_BIRTH_BLOCK and RATTERY_RPC
# must identify the same chain/token/archive as the snapshot.
